{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "门没装锁",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 142.41,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "合约里每一个修改状态的函数，都要回答一个问题：谁可以调用我？",
   "spoken": "合约里每一个修改状态的函数，都要回答一个问题：谁可以掉用我？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.472,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 6.233
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "如果答案是任何人，就必须证明，任何人调用都安全。",
   "spoken": "如果答案是任何人，就必须证明，任何人掉用都安全。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 7.572,
   "dur": 4.848,
   "speechStart": 7.67,
   "speechEnd": 11.574
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "打个比方。合约像一栋写字楼。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。合约像一栋写字楼。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.64,
   "dur": 3.552,
   "speechStart": 12.738,
   "speechEnd": 15.354
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "public 函数是大堂的门，谁都能进。",
   "spoken": "public 函数是大堂的门，谁都能进。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.412,
   "dur": 3.576,
   "speechStart": 16.51,
   "speechEnd": 19.152
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "onlyOwner 函数是机房的门，要刷卡。",
   "spoken": "onlyOwner 函数是机房的门，要刷卡。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.208,
   "dur": 3.936,
   "speechStart": 20.306,
   "speechEnd": 23.294
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "这个比方有一处不成立。写字楼可以换锁。",
   "spoken": "这个比方有一处不成立。写字楼可以换锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 24.364,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 24.462,
   "speechEnd": 27.924
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "合约如果不能升级，锁一旦装错，就永远是错的。",
   "spoken": "合约如果不能升级，锁一旦装错，就永远是错的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 28.976,
   "dur": 4.704,
   "speechStart": 29.074,
   "speechEnd": 32.859
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "谁会来试这些门？大致有五类。",
   "spoken": "谁会来试这些门？大致有五类。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.9,
   "dur": 3.552,
   "speechStart": 33.998,
   "speechEnd": 36.626
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "任意外部地址，恶意合约，被钓鱼的特权用户，拿到私钥的攻击者。",
   "spoken": "任意外部地址，恶意合约，被钓鱼的特权用户，拿到私钥的攻击者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 37.672,
   "dur": 6.048,
   "speechStart": 37.77,
   "speechEnd": 42.889
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "还有内部人员，他们本来就合法持有权限。",
   "spoken": "还有内部人员，他们本来就合法持有权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 43.94,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 44.038,
   "speechEnd": 47.169
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "下面看六种常见缺陷。先看前三种。",
   "spoken": "下面看六种常见缺陷。先看前三种。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 48.24,
   "dur": 4.512,
   "speechStart": 48.338,
   "speechEnd": 51.93
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "第一种，缺少权限检查。",
   "spoken": "第一种，缺少权限检查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 52.972,
   "dur": 3.048,
   "speechStart": 53.07,
   "speechEnd": 55.177
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "一个增发函数，对外公开，却没有修饰器。任何地址，都能给自己印币。",
   "spoken": "一个增发函数，对外公开，却没有修饰器。任何地址，都能给自己印币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 56.24,
   "dur": 7.176,
   "speechStart": 56.338,
   "speechEnd": 62.573
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "修复是加上 onlyRole，只认持有 MINTER 角色的地址。",
   "spoken": "修复是加上 onlyRole，只认持有 MINTER 决色的地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 63.636,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 63.734,
   "speechEnd": 67.138
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "老合约还有一个坑。Solidity 0.5 之前，函数默认是 public。",
   "spoken": "老合约还有一个坑。Solidity 0.5 之前，函数默认是 public。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 68.2,
   "dur": 6.792,
   "speechStart": 68.298,
   "speechEnd": 74.152
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "忘写可见性，内部函数就暴露给了所有人。",
   "spoken": "忘写可见性，内部函数就暴露给了所有人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 75.212,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 75.31,
   "speechEnd": 78.643
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "第二种，用 tx.origin 做鉴权。",
   "spoken": "第二种，用 tx.origin 做鉴权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 79.704,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 79.802,
   "speechEnd": 82.718
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "tx.origin，是最初签名的那个外部账户。",
   "spoken": "tx.origin，是最初签名的那个外部账户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 83.764,
   "dur": 4.368,
   "speechStart": 83.862,
   "speechEnd": 87.278
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "管理员去领空投，调用了攻击者的合约。攻击者的合约，再来调用你的。",
   "spoken": "管理员去领空投，掉用了攻击者的合约。攻击者的合约，再来掉用你的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 88.352,
   "dur": 6.432,
   "speechStart": 88.45,
   "speechEnd": 93.959
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "这时 tx.origin 仍然是管理员。检查通过了。",
   "spoken": "这时 tx.origin 仍然是管理员。检查通过了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 95.004,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 95.102,
   "speechEnd": 99.694
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "修复是改看 msg.sender，也就是直接调用者。中间的合约，冒充不了它。",
   "spoken": "修复是改看 msg.sender，也就是直接掉用者。中间的合约，冒充不了它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-20.mp3",
   "start": 100.744,
   "dur": 7.296,
   "speechStart": 100.842,
   "speechEnd": 107.196
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "第三种，未保护的初始化函数。",
   "spoken": "第三种，未保护的初始化函数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-21.mp3",
   "start": 108.26,
   "dur": 3.576,
   "speechStart": 108.358,
   "speechEnd": 110.989
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "可升级合约和克隆合约，用 initialize 代替构造函数。",
   "spoken": "可升级合约和克隆合约，用 initialize 代替构造函数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-22.mp3",
   "start": 112.056,
   "dur": 5.4,
   "speechStart": 112.154,
   "speechEnd": 116.606
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "如果它没人调用，或者能被重复调用，谁先调用，谁就是 owner。",
   "spoken": "如果它没人掉用，或者能被虫复掉用，谁先掉用，谁就是 owner。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-23.mp3",
   "start": 117.676,
   "dur": 5.736,
   "speechStart": 117.774,
   "speechEnd": 122.559
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-24",
   "text": "修复有两步。第一步，加上 initializer 修饰器，只允许执行一次。",
   "spoken": "修复有两步。第一步，加上 initializer 修饰器，只允许执行一次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-24.mp3",
   "start": 123.632,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 123.73,
   "speechEnd": 129.513
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-25",
   "text": "第二步，在实现合约的构造函数里，调用 disableInitializers，把实现合约本身锁死。",
   "spoken": "第二步，在实现合约的构造函数里，掉用 disableInitializers，把实现合约本身锁死。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-25.mp3",
   "start": 130.572,
   "dur": 6.696,
   "speechStart": 130.67,
   "speechEnd": 136.431
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-26",
   "text": "开头的 Parity 库合约，缺的正是这一步。",
   "spoken": "开头的 Parity 库合约，缺的正是这一步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg2-26.mp3",
